{"version":1,"content":"<p>《俠盜獵車6》終於正式上線。這部玩家期盼已久的系列續作，距離《GTA5》登陸PS3與Xbox 360平台已過去13年，是遊戲行業當之無愧的裏程碑時刻。顯然Rockstar Games也深有同感，工作室一向低調的聯合創始人兼總裁特意發佈罕見聲明，歡迎玩家踏入萊昂尼達州。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586964.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.745975+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:13:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"3e538c3d1e18fc8de75960a7bcd606797819deca0ed7ce40bbd737cf1ff447ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}